              <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
  <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__img">
    <img src="https://pxl-flccedu.terminalfour.net/fit-in/390x390/filters:quality(85)/filters:format(webp)/526x0:3690x3164/prod01/flcc-cdn-pxl/media/flccedu/content-assets/images/academics/healthcare-nursing/healthcare-nursing-smiling_students-2022-1.jpg" alt="FLCC Nursing program graduates McKayla Moore and Allyssa Richmond."/>  </div>

  <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__block bg-white">
    <h3 class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__title">McKayla Moore</h3>
    <a href="/academics/programs/nursing-registered-nurse-rn-aas/" class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__subtitle">Nursing (A.A.S.)</a>
    
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__quotemark">“</div>
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__content">
      <p>Enrolling in FLCC's Nursing program was the best choice I ever made. This program not only teaches you how to become a registered nurse but also the value of good work ethic, friendship, and personal integrity.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__quotemark ml-auto">”</div>
  </div>
</div><div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
  <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__img">
    <img src="https://pxl-flccedu.terminalfour.net/fit-in/390x390/filters:quality(85)/filters:format(webp)/142x0:5520x5378/prod01/flcc-cdn-pxl/media/flccedu/content-assets/images/people/smiling-outside-spring-2019-1b.jpg" alt="Michael Tucker"/>  </div>

  <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__block bg-white">
    <h3 class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__title">Michael Tucker '17</h3>
    <a href="/academics/programs/fine-arts-as/" class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__subtitle">Fine Arts (A.S.)</a>
    
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__quotemark">“</div>
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__content">
      <p>After retiring from 21 years of military service, FLCC became my extended family, supporting me during my entire journey. They ensure the success of all veteran students and their families. I'm grateful and blessed to be a graduate of FLCC.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__quotemark ml-auto">”</div>
  </div>
</div><div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
  <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__img">
    <img class="image-top" src="https://pxl-flccedu.terminalfour.net/fit-in/390x390/filters:quality(85)/filters:format(webp)/86x0:2981x2895/prod01/flcc-cdn-pxl/media/flccedu/content-assets/images/people/alumni/alumni-teaching_assistant-2022-1b.jpg" alt="Samantha Hoover"/>  </div>

  <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__block bg-white">
    <h3 class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__title">Samantha Hoover '22</h3>
    <a href="/academics/programs/teaching-assistant-certificate/" class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__subtitle">Teaching Assistant (Certificate)</a>
    
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__quotemark">“</div>
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__content">
      <p>I learned a lot of different teaching styles and methods. We'd talk about how to engage the children. We bounced ideas off one another. It was an eye-opening experience.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__quotemark ml-auto">”</div>
  </div>
</div><div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
  <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__img">
    <img class="image-top" src="https://pxl-flccedu.terminalfour.net/fit-in/390x390/filters:quality(85)/filters:format(webp)/0x207:3296x3503/prod01/flcc-cdn-pxl/media/flccedu/content-assets/images/people/alumni/alumni-web_and_mobile-2023-1c.jpg" alt="Sean Britton-Milligan"/>  </div>

  <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__block bg-white">
    <h3 class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__title">Connor Bashaw '23</h3>
    <a href="/academics/programs/web-and-mobile-development-aas/" class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__subtitle">Web and Mobile Development (A.A.S.)</a>
    
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__quotemark">“</div>
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__content">
      <p>The capstone class is great. You start dreaming up ideas for a project on day one. Then you build a team, make a plan, and get to work. The students get full control over the project, which makes our portfolios shine.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slider-type-2__swiper-slide__quotemark ml-auto">”</div>
  </div>
</div></div>

